  "details": "I find it so stupid that they lowered the poly count to 10k. That is not enough to do anything to make a chatacter. It's ridiculous that they are making quest users so needlessly limited. It's making a lot of quest people not want to play vrchat anymore because they can't do anything. Yes I understand they are trying to make quest users have the ability to play easier but liken it's no fun not being able to do anything or create avatars! Please up the poly count availabilty to 20-30k. I beg you.",
